      "copyBlocks": [
        {
          "id": "seed-block-1",
          "slot": "intro",
          "heading": "Five minutes from Kabalana Beach",
          "body": "A family runs this place, and they set out to make you feel at home from the moment you arrive. Kabalana Beach is a five-minute walk.\n\nDorms if you want the company, private rooms if you don't."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-2",
          "slot": "offer",
          "heading": "Dorms and private rooms",
          "body": "Mixed, female and male dormitories with bunk beds, plus double rooms and deluxe doubles. Every room has air conditioning and a fan, private lockers and a personal fridge. The bathrooms are modern and the showers are hot.\n\nRates change with the dates, and the booking links below show what is actually free."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-3",
          "slot": "about",
          "heading": "Breakfast, every day",
          "body": "Rotis, fruit, pancakes and eggs, with vegan options."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-4",
          "slot": "info",
          "heading": "What is here",
          "body": "There's a green garden and a chill zone, and free filtered water you can refill any time. Laundry service is available, and there's a minimarket on site. You can rent a scooter, and it can come with a surf rack. Luggage storage and lockers, too. Reception is open 24 hours.\n\nPets are welcome on request at no charge. Children are not accommodated."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-5",
          "slot": "about",
          "heading": "What guests say about the staff",
          "body": "\"Family\" is the word guests keep using. One of them caught dengue in Kandy and wrote that the staff helped nurse her back to health with Ayurvedic medicines, on top of what the hospital was already giving her.\n\nOn Booking.com the staff get 9.9 out of 10, the hostel's highest score there. Hostelworld guests give them the same 9.9, and only value for money and security do better, both at a full 10."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-6",
          "slot": "info",
          "heading": "Getting here",
          "body": "Ahangama, a five-minute walk from Kabalana Beach. Koggala Airport is about 5 km away; Ahangama railway station is a little over 2 km. The property arranges a shuttle."
        }
      ],
