      "testimonials": [
        {
          "id": "seed-quote-1",
          "quote": "It's a calm and quiet place, a wonderful staff, caring owners and clean. I had a really good time even i havnt spent much time there. beds are compfy and it has aircon and warm water.",
          "author": "Wolfgang, Austria",
          "source": "booking",
          "date": null
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-quote-2",
          "quote": "Great family owned hostel :-) they are really friendly and helpful! The breakfast always consists of a typical Sri Lankan dish (roti, hoppers,…) which changes every day and additionally a great fruit platter!! Dorms are big, bathrooms are nice with the whole outdoor thing :-)",
          "author": "Elena, Germany",
          "source": "hostelworld",
          "date": "2026-03"
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-quote-3",
          "quote": "I got dengue in Kandy and the staff at KA helped nurse me back to health with Ayurvedic medicines (on top of what the hospital was already giving me) They are the kindest people and they attract good vibes. I met some of the best people here :)",
          "author": "Mia, USA",
          "source": "hostelworld",
          "date": "2026-02"
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-quote-4",
          "quote": "Lovely location away from the main road. So close to the beach! The most amazing family who look after you like you're one of their own. Thank you KA!",
